              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">IsoFlex LAL</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Gel therapeutic support surface</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Designed to help mitigate the three key contributors of skin breakdown: pressure, shear and microclimate imbalance.<sup>1</sup></span></span></p>\n",
