          "hideComponent": "false",
          "topMargin": "3",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 21 2024 13:47:46 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Pressure, shear and microclimate management</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">IsoFlex LAL is a gel therapeutic support surface that helps reduce the risk of pressure injuries by managing the three key contributors of skin breakdown: pressure, shear and microclimate imbalance.<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">ShearGel and CoreGel components are designed to buckle and move freely with the patient.<sup>2</sup><br>\n </span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Microclimate technology delivers airflow to help manage heat and humidity at the patient's skin.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">10 year warranty<sup>3</sup></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu May 08 2025 15:42:19 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
